Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 11:33:32 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 15/18] Revert "env: support --env0-from to read NUL separated
 vars from file"

This reverts commit adb4d9879962456d96bcde126cbba9356cc16f05.
NEWS left untouched.
---
 THANKS.in              |   1 -
 doc/coreutils.texi     |  13 -----
 src/env.c              |  78 ++++-------------------------
 tests/env/env0-from.sh | 111 -----------------------------------------
 tests/local.mk         |   1 -
 5 files changed, 10 insertions(+), 194 deletions(-)
 delete mode 100755 tests/env/env0-from.sh

